<createdBy>HALAR</createdBy>
<createdTime>2020-07-21 09:14:29 UTC</createdTime>
<comment><![CDATA[Type of the QC's packaging according to the code proposed in the tab "Table Units" of the "Packaging" field Rules :
A different QCT value corresponds to each packaging unit. Example: BX box for 1 unit, CT box for 10 units, PF pallet for 500 units.
For the smallest value of QC, QCT is equal to QMVT of COMMERCE. QMVT = packaging type of QMV.]]></comment>
